{"spec": "ACP v1. Initialization: authMethods, AuthMethod type (absent or agent, or terminal) (https://agentclientprotocol.com/protocol/initialization). Authentication: authenticate, methodId; terminal methods are never passed to authenticate; auth_required error (https://agentclientprotocol.com/protocol/v1/authentication). Schema v1 ErrorCode -32000 'Authentication required'. Timing of authenticate relative to session/new is UNVERIFIED; this fixture follows the machine's rule: session/new first, then authenticate when it returns auth required."}
{"event": "connect", "cwd": "/home/user/project", "at": 0, "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "initialize", "params": {"protocolVersion": 1, "clientCapabilities": {"fs": {"readTextFile": false, "writeTextFile": false}, "terminal": false}, "clientInfo": {"name": "rvim", "version": "<any>"}}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 5, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"protocolVersion": 1, "agentCapabilities": {"loadSession": false}, "authMethods": [{"id": "cli-login", "name": "Log in in a terminal", "type": "terminal"}, {"id": "oauth", "name": "Sign in with the browser", "description": "Opens a browser window."}]}}, "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "session/new", "params": {"cwd": "/home/user/project", "mcpServers": []}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 10, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "error": {"code": -32000, "message": "Authentication required"}}, "expect": [{"notice": "auth_required", "methods": [{"id": "cli-login", "name": "Log in in a terminal", "terminal": true}, {"id": "oauth", "name": "Sign in with the browser", "terminal": false}]}], "state": "NeedsAuth"}
{"event": "authenticate", "at": 20, "method": "cli-login", "expect": [{"notice": "request_failed", "turn": null, "message": "terminal authentication is not supported yet"}], "state": "NeedsAuth"}
{"event": "authenticate", "at": 25, "method": "oauth", "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "authenticate", "params": {"methodId": "oauth"}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 60000, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {}}, "expect": [{"notice": "authenticated"}, {"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "method": "session/new", "params": {"cwd": "/home/user/project", "mcpServers": []}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 60010, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"sessionId": "sess_after_login"}}, "expect": [{"notice": "connected", "session": "sess_after_login"}], "state": "Ready"}
